  "cross_tradition_view": "Many listed traditions would commend the answer’s candor, uncertainty, and concern for a possible child, but the virtue lists do not settle this specific case. Franklin’s restrictive Chastity may condemn the permissive conclusion, while tolerance-oriented approaches support leaving a consensual private choice to the adults; the AI’s own answer also splits between those positions.",
